    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are excited to present this two bedroom 2nd floor apartment to the market in the quiet development of Kilwarden court, located on the Boot Road within minutes' walk of Clondalkin Village. The M50 and N7 are located close by and make commuting around Dublin and beyond hassle free. Within minutes' walk you will find a host of shops, bars and restaurants. Local schools are within walking distance and bus routes are located at the front of the development. Clondalkin Village and The Mill shopping centre are in close proximity too. Bright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 62 sq m comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen/diner/living room with balcony to rear, two bedrooms and a main family bathroom. No. 14 is presented in very good condition throughout and boasts a long list of additional features to include no onward chain, gated underground parking and is Ideal for first time buyers & downsizers alike. Early viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\n\nFeatures\n\nBER C\nC. 62 sqm\n2 double bedrooms\nC. 2300 Mgt Fee per annum\nNo onward chain\nWell presented throughout\nWalking distance to Clondalkin village\nElectric storage heaters\nSecure underground parking\nClose to all local amenities\nPopular development\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nD22 KN34\n\n\n"
      },
      {
